  "candidate": {
    "name": "intraday_range_weak_order_time_reversal_divergence_236t",
    "direction": "higher",
    "formula": "For the exact 236 overlapping within-half triples of x_i=ln(high_i/low_i), classify each exact zero-tolerance comparison key into one of 13 transitive weak-order states, let p be their pooled frequency and q_s=p_R(s) under exact triple reversal, and return JSD(p,q)/ln(2).",
